# Dependencies and local noise — never published, never committed.
node_modules/
pnpm-debug.log*
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo

# NOTE: lib/ and client/ are deliberately NOT ignored.
# They are the build output (tsdown), and they are committed on purpose so a
# GitHub install — `dsh plugin --profile web add github:liuhui/dsh-llm-balance`,
# which fetches the repo with no build step of its own — gets a working plugin.
# Run `pnpm run check` (typecheck + build + tests + preflight) before committing
# after any change under src/.
